{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"凡建築房屋，本府工務局認為有建築共同壁必要者，應通知雙方業主協議建\n築共同壁。","id":"臺北市-FL004115/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"8ee503877546524fbeda0cbd219f36b43638b43cfa45541dfe0c284121599f98","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"共同壁之構造，須依耐火壁構造之規定，同時計算雙方房屋之安全載量。","id":"臺北市-FL004115/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"2fae20a8fa57ce0d592623af90315c0d483eb421667413f4bea2bd7f252b0d53","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"共同壁之中心應在相鄰兩地境界線上。","id":"臺北市-FL004115/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"06863241222d80f2dd40e0845eb1249f3f6f8e7d5abdd98ae0ae47768100f349","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"共同壁之雙方業主，如不能取得協議時，得報請本府工務局予以調解。","id":"臺北市-FL004115/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"2fc8dfba948764d534ec4d5fad2fae3b3e72a2748253c037d5a8a2d3b512e8e2","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"一方使用他方已成立共同壁，以負擔工料費之半數為原則，如雙方發生爭執\n時，得由任何一方呈請本府工務局核定。","id":"臺北市-FL004115/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"71615f81119deeb26d523b49846033a4cdcf2f71447ab4c118e7144bfd1edbd7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"本規則自公布日施行。","id":"臺北市-FL004115/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"4be1c78bc2763a96ec96ab25839c688ec554349dacbfa909b27048eb67e671e2","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"臺北市-FL004115","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"臺北市建築共同壁規則","region":"臺北市","source":"臺北市法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://laws.gov.taipei/Law/LawSearch/LawArticleContent/FL004115","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:31:33+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"9517eb9546a0d1e45894d14bbc46ef2caf64bb9b3d1c1ba53a7cf41fead348cc","sourceRecordId":"臺北市-FL004115","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}